def account(o):
 return f"""Root's {L(o,'final synthetic19 acceptance','root-checker19-runtime-prep002/ROOT_SYNTHETIC_CHECKER19_ACCEPTANCE_002.json')} (`9f4894f2`) selects the {L(o,'different actual review','metadata3-checker19-runtime-audit-prep001/INDEPENDENT_ACTUAL_CHECKER19_REVIEW_002.json')} (`68b20f2c`) and {L(o,'post-observation','metadata3-checker19-runtime-audit-prep001/POST_ACTUAL_CHECKER19_REVIEW_002.json')} (`28d1c0f0`). Actual attempt002 passed **19 direct methods and 24 subtests**, with **62 complete events, zero failures/errors/skips and zero diagnostic bytes**. These are separate counts; subtests are not additional direct methods. {L(o,'Result','root-checker19-runtime002/result.json')} `e6b304be`, discovery `5e45056f`, source-byte proof `eed8182f` and raw captures are preserved.

The {L(o,'retained physical Root witness','root-checker19-runtime-prep002/ROOT_PHYSICAL_EXECUTION_WITNESS_002.json')} (`748a384a`) correlates tool766898, exit0 and **1.4931448 seconds**, within physical60 including cleanup. Parent002's genuine PS7 interval was09:58:39.5986912-09:58:40.9156800 UTC; runner Py6 timestamps are qualified separately. The reviewer externally corroborates Root's owning-tool correlation; its second-resolution clock bracket has conservative upper2 seconds, not an exact duration. Direct drain/reap and Source/runtime4 bytes/raw9 were reconciled. This is synthetic regression acceptance for selected helper008 only, not real project metadata, checker009's planned25, utility007, current24, full runtime inventories/loaded dependencies, hard Job/descendants, native recovery or science. Attempt002 and GO `6012545c` are spent.
"""
def refusal(o):
 return f"""Attempt001 was refused before Python child entry: toolfd1522 exit1/wall0.4242815 at09:31:41 UTC, terminal `7b927fa` failure "No BOM". {L(o,'Different refusal review','metadata3-checker19-runtime-audit-prep001/INDEPENDENT_ACTUAL_CHECKER19_REFUSAL_001.json')} (`084490d4`) and Root witness `aa8f3abc` preserve absent parent-start/private output/child/tests. No test ran. {L(o,'Native ordinal/BOM observation','metadata3-checker19-runtime-audit-prep001/NATIVE_ORDINAL_BOM_AND_PS_AST_OBSERVATION_002.json')} (`e1c51b4c`) corroborates Root experiment36c9c1: en-US default StartsWith(U+FEFF) wrongly matched plain JSON, while Ordinal refused plain JSON and detected a genuine BOM. The original source audit missed this cultural behavior. The separate prep002 source changes only that semantic comparison and declared identities; all Python function/class ASTs remain exact and PowerShell parser errors are zero. Genuine {L(o,'Source002 receipt','metadata3-checker19-runtime-audit-prep001/INDEPENDENT_CHECKER19_RUNNER_SOURCE_REVIEW_002.json')} `e6b5136f` precedes the new GO. Source001, parent001 and GO `455c8a14` remain preserved/spent, never replayed.

